hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2733","**
Narrated to us Yusuf ibn Musa, narrated to us Jarir, from 'Ata' ibn al-Sa'ib.

And narrated to us Muhammad ibn Musa al-Harashi and Ziyad ibn 'Abdullah, narrated to us 'Ata' ibn al-Sa'ib, from Sa'id ibn Jubayr, from Ibn 'Abbas, from the Prophet (ﷺ), who said:

""The Black Stone descended from Paradise, whiter than milk, but the sins of the sons of Adam turned it black.""

---"
